Auren
=====
Auren = Advanced Unified Retrieval Engine

In simple terms; search through a file system by text queries.

Stack
-----
GUI          - Tauri
Backend      - Go
Vector Store - FAISS
Embeddings   - (MiniLM) / (bge-m3 / nomic-embed-text) / (mxbai-embed-large)

Run (test)
---
Init python embed server: `py python/embed.py`
Init go backend server  : `go run ./cmd/server`
sample test cmd: `curl -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"query":"what is cloud computing","top_k":1}' http://localhost:8080/search`